# nextPowerOfTwo

- _nextPowerOfTwo(n)_

Answers the next power of two greater than or equal to the integer _n_.

```
>>> 300.nextPowerOfTwo
512

>>> 512.nextPowerOfTwo
512
```

At `LargeInteger`:

```
>>> 13L.factorial.nextPowerOfTwo
8589934592

>>> 8589934592.nthRoot(33)
2

>>> 2 ^ 33
8589934592
```

* * *

See also: bitShift, highBit, isPowerOfTwo, previousPowerOfTwo

Guides: Bitwise Functions, Integer Functions

Categories: Truncation, Rounding
